WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Hi, I’m Cat.

00:01.000 --> 00:03.000
Would you call yourself a gardener?
Yes. Why?

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Because I have had a garden, and I try to have a garden.
Um, as often as I can.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
My mom’s side of the family are all gardeners,
so every time I would visit my grandma,

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
she would instantly take us from the car to her garden.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.000
So I always wanted to do it. I was always around it.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.400
I liked the idea of having everything from scratch,
and from something that you grew outside.
